00:51:31,400 --> 00:51:35,540
We don't have that mindset of odd jobs culturally.

775
00:51:35,620 --> 00:51:36,660
Not at all.

776
00:51:36,740 --> 00:51:39,660
So that's why we never made odd jobs.

777
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:42,020
And we don't even get odd jobs.

